the russian ukraine conflict has  obviously got the eyes of the world and  of course as soon as you see financial  sanctions and all types of censorship  people immediately jump and start  talking about bitcoin and  cryptocurrencies as a tool for russia to  evade those sanctions there's a lot of  people who are presenting these  technologies as simply being able to  help the bad guys but that's not  actually the only way remember bitcoin  and other cryptocurrencies these are  neutral technologies they can be used by  friend or foe and what we saw over the  weekend was that the official ukraine  government came out and they actually  solicited donations from the global  population saying stand with the people  of ukraine they now are accepting  cryptocurrency donations bitcoin  ethereum and usdt they included the  addresses for those types of assets that  anyone in the world with an internet  connection that had bitcoin ethereum or  tether could simply go ahead and donate  to the ukraine cause now what we saw is  that actually on a public ledger you can  see exactly who's donating how much and  where those assets are going and so  elliptic put together this graphic that  shows that about 56  came in bitcoin 31 in ethereum and about  10 or so coming in stable coins and  ultimately those crypto assets were  being donated they're there to help the  ukraine people go ahead and buy critical  supplies in their defense of their  sovereign nation now i don't think very  many people had on their 2022 bingo cart  that we would see a nation state openly  soliciting donations from the global  population in bitcoin and  cryptocurrencies but when you have all  sorts of economic sanctions when you  have inferior technology around two or  three days settlement times in the u.s  dollar system or the legacy banking  system it is becoming very obvious that  bitcoin and cryptocurrencies are  superior technology anyone with an  internet connection can go ahead and now  send economic value to the cause that  they want to support and ultimately  ukraine is pioneering a positive use for  these technologies plenty of people  continue to talk about the negative uses  of bitcoin and cryptocurrencies in times  of violent conflict but ukraine putting  on an example of exactly why these  technologies can help the good people as  well
 

